{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-007-01","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyRevertDialogTests.cs","line":208,"method":"RetryCallback_GeneratesFreshSession_ClearsMarker_ReinvokesRewind","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RevertInterceptor.cs:270; skip ClearActiveReFlySessionMarker -> red","what_it_asserts":"retry clears the active marker and re-invokes rewind with the captured RP + slot","why_weak":"the fresh session id is generated inside RewindInvoker.StartInvoke (RewindInvoker.cs:835), which the test replaces with RewindInvokeStartForTesting, so the name's GeneratesFreshSession claim is not exercised by this test","proposed_action":"rename to RetryCallback_ClearsMarker_ReinvokesRewindWithCapturedRpAndSlot","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-007-02","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyRevertDialogTests.cs","line":403,"method":"DiscardReFly_PrelaunchContext_VAB_TransitionsToVAB_StartupCleanSetOnEditor","category":"T3","severity":"Low","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/RevertInterceptor.cs:712; swap the Prelaunch branch to GameScenes.SPACECENTER -> red","what_it_asserts":"DiscardReFly with Prelaunch/VAB dispatches the scene seam with GameScenes.EDITOR + EditorFacility.VAB","why_weak":"EditorDriver.StartupBehaviour = START_CLEAN and EditorDriver.editorFacility are set only in the production-only DispatchScene branch (RevertInterceptor.cs:721-722), which is skipped whenever DiscardReFlyLoadSceneForTesting is wired; the test never observes those presets. The SPH twin (line 427) shares the gap","proposed_action":"rename both to ..._TransitionsToEditorAtVAB / _AtSPH, or add a seam that captures the startup-behaviour/facility presets","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
{"kind":"finding","id":"F-rewind-refly-007-03","file":"Source/Parsek.Tests/ReFlyRevertDialogTests.cs","line":677,"method":"DiscardReFly_UnfinishedFlightsEntryForThisSplit_StaysVisible","category":"T3","severity":"Medium","confidence":"high","falsifiability":"falsifiability: Source/Parsek/MergeDialog.ReFlyDiscard.cs:197; an over-broad attempt-id removal that also drops the origin recording's RewindPoint -> red","what_it_asserts":"EffectiveState.IsUnfinishedFlight(origin) remains true after DiscardReFly","why_weak":"TryResolveUnfinishedFlight admits a recording whose slot anchor cannot resolve (EffectiveState.cs:966-968), so the assertion stays green even if the origin Recording is pruned out of RecordingStore.CommittedRecordings; the row's real visibility gate is store membership (EffectiveState.cs:996). The named property (row stays visible) is therefore only partially covered","proposed_action":"after the handler, assert RecordingStore.CommittedRecordings still contains marker.OriginChildRecordingId","effort":"S","july_ref":"none"}
